// Stubs for weapon settings that name a script callback this build does
// not implement. Without them the engine refuses to precache the weapon.
// A few callbacks take different arguments on the two engines, so those
// are split the same way the hand-written weapon scripts split them.
// Each stub announces itself the first time it runs.

